@startuml 01_system_context
!includeurl https://raw.githubusercontent.com/plantuml-stdlib/C4-PlantUML/master/C4_Context.puml

title C4 Level 1 - System Context (As-Is)
LAYOUT_WITH_LEGEND()

Person(customer, "Customer", "Submits an order with customer, item and shipping data")

System(platform, "E-Commerce Cloud Platform", "Implemented order creation module exposed through a REST API")

Rel(customer, platform, "Creates an order", "HTTP/JSON")

note right of platform
Current implemented scope:
- POST /orders
- Order creation and validation
- Inventory availability check
- In-memory order repository
- In-process event publication

External identity, payment, delivery,
database and broker integrations
are not part of the running deployment.
end note

SHOW_LEGEND()
@enduml
